    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to add some excitement to your night owl life? Look no further than the Midnight Arcade! Open exclusively overnight, as long as you're open to breaking in, this VR experience lets you have fun with some fun Laser tag and Mini golf in a long abandoned arcade building, all in one package!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mini golf, you'll be on the outside of the premises, exploring the holes, checking out the old gift shop, and playing the game as you go. Within Laser tag, you'll fight off long dormant robots as waves of enemies in a small arena.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to add some excitement to your night owl life? Look no further than the Midnight Arcade! Open exclusively overnight, as long as you're open to breaking in, this VR experience lets you have fun with some fun Laser tag and Mini golf in a long abandoned arcade building, all in one package!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mini golf, you'll be on the outside of the premises, exploring the holes, checking out the old gift shop, and playing the game as you go. Within Laser tag, you'll fight off long dormant robots as waves of enemies in a small arena.</p>",
    "short_description": "A compilation of two Arcade-Styled VR games, featuring both Mini Golf and Laser Tag. Play in an abandoned entertainment center, wander the premises, discover silly secrets, hit the golf balls into holes and defeat waves of robots in laser tag!",
